The risk types given to each abnormality,it references how much chaos an abnormality can cause in a short amount of time:
ZAYIN level are fairly harmless and sometimes even benefit people;
TETH level are a minor risk but anyone with E.G.O can handle them easily;
HE level are moderately dangerous but proper training and information severely reduce that danger;
WAW level can eventually be defeated but might result in many casualties;
ALEPH level are extremely powerful and most agents can't stand up to them,they can easily wipe out entire departments with relative ease.
